~ start
do CutsceneController.lock_input()
do CutsceneController.set_textbox_player_preset(Player.Players.LEGGY)
do CutsceneController.show_textbox()
if Statics.get_item_percentage() < 70.0
	NPC56: After this game is over,[wait=0.125] I'm going to get some pizza!!
else
	NPC56: I may be a turtle,[wait=0.125] but I'm also a musician!![wait=0.25]  I like to make sounds and stuff!!
=> END